{"text": " If monkeys have one banana, banana rare, banana valuable. But if monkeys grow more bananas, banana become common, banana not as valuable. Demand pole inflation. If monkeys demand more banana, but banana farmer makes same amount, banana price go up because banana more rare. Cost push inflation. If banana demand is the same, but banana farmer have less banana to sell, banana price go up because banana become more rare. Production cost inflation. Monkey buys banana. Monkey eat banana. Life is good. Monkey tell monkey friends about banana store. Monkeys buy all the bananas. Banana farmer has to plant more banana tree, but banana seed become more expensive. So banana farmer raise price of banana to cover cost.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.2, "text": " If monkeys have one banana, banana rare, banana valuable.", "tokens": [50363, 1002, 26697, 423, 530, 25996, 11, 25996, 4071, 11, 25996, 8119, 13, 50623], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17402092615763345, "compression_ratio": 2.021978021978022, "no_speech_prob": 0.00535545963793993}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 5.2, "end": 11.52, "text": " But if monkeys grow more bananas, banana become common, banana not as valuable.", "tokens": [50623, 887, 611, 26697, 1663, 517, 35484, 11, 25996, 1716, 2219, 11, 25996, 407, 355, 8119, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17402092615763345, "compression_ratio": 2.021978021978022, "no_speech_prob": 0.00535545963793993}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 11.52, "end": 13.200000000000001, "text": " Demand pole inflation.", "tokens": [50939, 34479, 16825, 10610, 13, 51023], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17402092615763345, "compression_ratio": 2.021978021978022, "no_speech_prob": 0.00535545963793993}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 13.200000000000001, "end": 18.56, "text": " If monkeys demand more banana, but banana farmer makes same amount,", "tokens": [51023, 1002, 26697, 3512, 517, 25996, 11, 475, 25996, 18739, 1838, 976, 2033